		<IUseCase type="e">
			<_id type="a">GUID 8a5a34f4-460e-4d13-8396-ec4e8a06f4be</_id>
			<_myState type="a">8192</_myState>
			<_name type="a">Movement</_name>
			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">1.2.1990::0:0:0</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">Movement%0D
The transition to the gate movement in the given direction rquires the following steps: %0D
1.Turn on the collision detector.%0D
2. Optional activation of the signalling lamp.%0D
3. Turning on the gate drive.%0D
During the movement taking place in a given direction, the following actions should be repeated every fixed period of time:%0D
1. Send a signal about the travelled distance to the Controller.%0D
2. Check the occurence of a collision and if the collision detector signals it, stop the gate movement.%0D
3. If the signalling option is active, flash the lamp.%0D
</_text>
